lculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025, February to March on the middle of the grids hit 23% of normal, and June to July reached 165%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 42% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 20827 had its driest year in 1954, at 48% of normal.</p>"}
